（经数字修改的石墨铅笔画与摄影合成作品）&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="woman in glasses with bangs wearing a head covering behind a background of digitally altered flowers" height="1024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/untilted/6add8708e51c6.png" width="1024"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://untilted.some.pics"&gt;@untilted&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 25 Oct 2026 04:35:24 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>发光的橙色南瓜灯装饰</title><link>https://some.pics/6add733097a14</link><description>&lt;p&gt;一组发光的橙色南瓜灯装饰品。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A group of glowing orange jack-o’-lantern decorations in various sizes arranged on the ground at night, with blue accent lighting illuminating the surrounding foliage." height="2268" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/dhester/6add733097a14.jpg" width="3402"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://dhester.some.pics"&gt;@dhester&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 25 Oct 2026 03:10:44 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>护身符不必一次做完。如果你打结或缝小袋累了，可以把它收起来，以后再继续。休息一下并不会让你已经倾注的用心白费。</title><link>https://some.pics/6add6dc082a0b</link><description>&lt;p&gt;护身符不必一次做完。如果你打结或缝小袋累了，可以把它收起来，以后再继续。休息一下并不会让你已经倾注的用心白费。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Painted charcoal-black and muted rose-pink storybook scene of a witch tending an unfinished knotted charm in a shallow basket inside a cream nautilus-shell home. A cushioned chair sits beside a sea-facing window with lantern boats and towering shells beyond. Warm ivory serif lettering fills the upper wall, and a gold emblem watermark appears at bottom-right. Text: A charm doesn't have to be finished in one sitting. Hello Miz Jeannie watermark." height="1024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hellomizjeannie/6add6dc082a0b.jpg" width="1024"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hellomizjeannie.some.pics"&gt;@hellomizjeannie&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 25 Oct 2026 02:47:31 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>停车库电梯塔</title><link>https://some.pics/6add492ad6423</link><description>&lt;p&gt;停车楼电梯塔&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Low-angle view of a dark lattice tower with decorative pulley wheels rising into a bright blue sky." height="4284" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/macmanx/6add492ad6423.jpg" width="5712"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://macmanx.some.pics"&gt;@macmanx&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 25 Oct 2026 00:11:29 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>恶魔风自拍</title><link>https://some.pics/6add4804cead1</link><description>&lt;p&gt;一张恶魔般的自拍 😈&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A person with pink hair and clear glasses smiles, wearing iridescent horns and animal earrings, with a neck tattoo, in front of a fountain and trees." height="2316" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/sjwallin/6add4804cead1.jpg" width="1737"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://sjwallin.some.pics"&gt;@sjwallin&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 25 Oct 2026 00:06:32 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>倒影池</title><link>https://some.pics/6add47c6ed318</link><description>&lt;p&gt;倒影池&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Smooth stones fill a man-made pond as water ripples and casts reflections of buildings." height="4284" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/macmanx/6add47c6ed318.jpg" width="5712"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://macmanx.some.pics"&gt;@macmanx&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 25 Oct 2026 00:05:31 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Helper游泳池，- Ranomi游泳池，格罗宁根。</title><link>https://some.pics/6add20a10f537</link><description>&lt;p&gt;Helper游泳池，- Ranomi游泳池，格罗宁根。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Helperzwembad, - Ranomibad, Groningen." height="4284" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/sybrand/6add20a10f537.jpg" width="5712"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://sybrand.some.pics"&gt;@sybrand&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 24 Oct 2026 21:18:30 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>